  n<//`define PER_SIZE_1_KB> u<317> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<318> f<1> l<179:1> el<179:24>
  n<//-------------------------------------------------------> u<318> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<319> f<1> l<183:1> el<183:58>
  n<// Defines the debugger CPU_CTL.RST_BRK_EN reset value> u<319> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<320> f<1> l<184:1> el<184:55>
  n<// (CPU break on PUC reset)> u<320> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<321> f<1> l<185:1> el<185:28>
  n<//-------------------------------------------------------> u<321> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<322> f<1> l<186:1> el<186:58>
  n<// When defined, the CPU will automatically break after> u<322> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<323> f<1> l<187:1> el<187:56>
  n<// a PUC occurrence by default. This is typically useful> u<323> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<324> f<1> l<188:1> el<188:57>
  n<// when the program memory can only be initialized through> u<324> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<325> f<1> l<189:1> el<189:59>
  n<// the serial debug interface.> u<325> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<326> f<1> l<190:1> el<190:31>
  n<//-------------------------------------------------------> u<326> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<327> f<1> l<191:1> el<191:58>
