  n<//-------------------------------------------------------> u<383> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<384> f<1> l<261:1> el<261:58>
  n<// Custom Program/Data and Peripheral Memory Spaces> u<384> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<385> f<1> l<262:1> el<262:52>
  n<//-------------------------------------------------------> u<385> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<386> f<1> l<263:1> el<263:58>
  n<// The following values are valid only if the> u<386> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<387> f<1> l<264:1> el<264:46>
  n<// corresponding *_SIZE_CUSTOM defines are uncommented:> u<387> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10007> s<388> f<1> l<265:1> el<265:56>
