  n<// Enable the I2C broadcast address> u<346> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<4977> s<347> f<1> l<218:1> el<218:36>
  n<//-------------------------------------------------------> u<347> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<4977> s<348> f<1> l<219:1> el<219:58>
  n<// For multicore systems, a common I2C broadcast address> u<348> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<4977> s<349> f<1> l<220:1> el<220:57>
  n<// can be given to all oMSP cores in order to> u<349> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<4977> s<350> f<1> l<221:1> el<221:46>
