  n<//   - DBG_HWBRK_0 -> Include hardware breakpoints unit 0> u<360> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<4977> s<361> f<1> l<234:1> el<234:58>
  n<//   - DBG_HWBRK_1 -> Include hardware breakpoints unit 1> u<361> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<4977> s<362> f<1> l<235:1> el<235:58>
